      "incoming": [],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Go on...",
      "JA_current": "続けてくれ…。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_0#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "11",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_11",
      "next": [
        "111",
        "112"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_1_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "So, your first fight? Your opponent is a piece of meat just like you. He's here because of debts and he only has two options: to come out and fight or to land himself in the nearest anomaly. He's gonna fight like a cornered animal. Equipment for today... lemme think... OK! Why don't you two use PMm's...two mags each should be plenty. Either you kick his arse or we feed you to the dogs - not much of a choice. Go on now.",
      "JA_current": "で、アンタ初めてかい？ 相手はアンタと同じく肉の塊だ。ヤツは借金のカタにここにいるわけだが、ヤツには2つの選択肢があったんだ。ここで戦うか、それともアノーマリーの近くに置いてかれるかのどちらかってわけだ。だから、奴さん死に物狂いだぜ。装備は… そうだな。よし、互いに PMm と弾倉2個ずつってので十分だろ？ どうだい？ ヤツをぶっ飛ばすか、それともアンタが犬のエサになるかのどっちかだけだ。用意は良いか？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_11#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "12",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_12",
      "next": [
        "121",
        "122"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_2_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_1_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Your last fight didn't mean shit. You're still the same piece of meat you were before and no self-respecting person will bet a single mag on you. If you wanna earn some proper cash you're gonna have to make a few more appearances in the arena. Your new opponent also got through the first round and his fight was a lot harder than yours. I don't like him, to be honest - he kills too quickly and the crowd doesn't like that. So, go and show us what you can do! The stakes will increase after this fight - all you gotta do is stay alive. Move it!",
      "JA_current": "この前のファイトは悪くなかったぜ。だが、まだお前は単なる肉の塊だ。自尊心のある奴なら、お前にマガジン1個だって賭けやしない。まだ金が欲しいってんなら、アリーナに2、3回出てもらおうか。今度の対戦相手は、お前よりキツい1回戦を勝ち上がってるんだが、はっきり言って、ヤツは金にならん。早く殺しすぎて、客のウケが悪い。で、お前の力を借りたいんだが、どうだ。とにかく生きてさえいりゃ、賭けがデカくなるぜ。さぁ、行ってこい！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_12#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "13",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_13",
      "next": [
        "131",
        "132"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_3_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_2_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Well, well... You're not as much of a pussy as you first seemed. Now it's time to test you out in a real fight. You're up against two guys. The first one's called Swede and I don't remember the second one's name. They were paired up intentionally as they hate each other's guts so don't worry about them working as a team - they're more likely to shoot each other. Today is rifle day so don't let them get too close or we'll have to pick you up piece by piece. The odds are 10:1 so if you win you'll make a fair amount. Off you go!",
      "JA_current": "アンタ、思ってたよりやるな。そこでだ。今度は本当の戦いってモンを味わってもらう。2対1で戦ってもらうんだが、1人は Swede ってヤツで、もう1人は… 忘れちまった。まぁ、とにかく、お互いに憎しみあってるってんで組ませたわけだから、ヤツらが連携するだとか、そんな心配はないから安心しろ。それより同士撃ちしそうな勢いだぜ。それと、今日の得物はライフルだからな。あんまりヤツらを近づけちまうと、蜂の巣になったアンタの始末をしなけりゃならん。気をつけてくれよ。オッズは10：1だから、勝てばデカいぜ。さぁ、行ってこい！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_13#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "14",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_14",
      "next": [
        "141",
        "142"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_4_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_3_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Well, now I can safely say that you're a fighter, a real fighter. Now it's time for a team fight. You get to fight with two rookies - two brothers - on your side. They haven't fought yet but they're brothers, so I had to put them into a team fight. I wouldn't expect any real help from them if I were you. You're fighting an experienced team, they're contenders for the final this season. A dangerous lot. They use different weapons but one has an automatic shotgun - be very careful with him. Good luck, pal... you're gonna need it.",
      "JA_current": "ようやく、あんたを本当の戦士と言うことができるな。さぁ、チーム戦の時間だ。あんたは2人の新米 ― 2人の兄弟 ― と一緒に戦うことができる。あいつらとはまだやりあっていないと思うが、あいつらは味方だ。もし俺があんたなら、あいつらの援護を期待はしねぇだろうな。今度は、あんたに経験豊かなチームと戦ってもらうんだが、ヤツらは今シーズンの決勝戦のための相手だ。かなりヤバイ。ヤツらはそれぞれ違う武器を使ってんだが、そのうち1人のオートマチック・ショットガンを持っているヤツに注意するんだ。幸運と仲間… あんたには必要だろう。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_14#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "15",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_15",
      "next": [
        "151",
        "152"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_5_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_4_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "You've got a special fight today. Even the army has heard about you! Don't be surprised, they fight here too - there's even a general in the crowd. These guys are from the Spetsnaz or from OMON. They're well armed and their armor is good as you'd expect. Don't worry though, I ain't gonna leave you out in the rain, either. You'll get a vest used by Freedom - it's light so it won't slow you down. Go on, show them that stalkers ain't no whipping boys. Good luck!",
      "JA_current": "今日は特別な戦いだ。Army さえアンタの噂で持ちきりだ！ そりゃそうさ、今日は彼らと戦う。観客席には将軍までもが来ている。こいつらはスペツナズ、あるいは特別警察の奴らだ。アンタの思ってる通り、奴らの武装は強力で、アーマーは厚い。だが心配するな、アンタを嵐の中に放り込もうなんて思っちゃいねえ。Freedom スーツが使える。これは軽くて動きやすい。よし行け、行ってストーカーが生贄じゃないってことを思い知らせてやれ。幸運を祈る！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_15#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "16",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_16",
      "next": [
        "161",
        "162"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_6_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_5_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Time for you to show what you can do. Duty captured a group of bandits that had been causing problems for stalkers near Rostok. Duty took 'em at night so most of the bandits were taken alive. They were all gonna be executed anyway so I convinced Duty to give them a chance. If any of them survive, they'll go in the can outside the Zone, which is better than dying here. They're not well-armed - just a few pistols and sawn-offs - but there's six of them so watch yourself. Go on now!",
      "JA_current": "アンタのやれることを見せてやる時だ。Rostok の近くでストーカーと騒ぎを起こしていた Bandit のグループを、Duty が捕えた。夜間の襲撃でほとんどの Bandit を生け捕りに出来たんだ。ヤツらは処刑されるところだったが、俺は Duty にヤツらにチャンスを与えるよう説得した。もし生き残れるなら、彼らはゾーンの外で刑務所に収監されるだろうが、ここで死ぬよりよっぽどいい。奴らの武装は貧弱だ。数丁のピストルと短銃身ショットガンのみ。だが6人いる、気を付けろ。さあ、行くんだ！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_16#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "17",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_17",
      "next": [
        "171",
        "172"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_7_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_6_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Well, you're almost in the final. Now you'll be fighting a real stalker. He's alone but he's got a real sweet weapon and he's sporting very decent ballistic armor. Catch one burst from his piece and you're toast. There will be a surprise that I can't tell you about too... Here's my advice: be prepared, it's gonna be tough. The winner makes it through to the final. Fight to the death, go!",
      "JA_current": "よし、後1つでファイナルだ。今度の相手は、ストーカーの中のストーカーだ。単独の相手だが、FT 200M を持ち、外骨格を身に着けている。一瞬を捕らえろ、お前は窮地にある。言葉に出来ないサプライズがあるだろう… 俺のアドバイスは： 心の準備をすること、タフな戦いになるはずだ。勝者がファイナル進出となる。死ぬまで戦え、行け！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_17#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "18",
      "text_id": "bar_arena_man_job_18",
      "next": [
        "181",
        "182"
      ],
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "dont_has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_8_done"
        },
        {
          "type": "has_info",
          "value": "bar_arena_fight_7_done"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "0"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Congratulations, you're in the final! One more to go and this one is to the death, every man for himself. There will be 4 other stalkers in the arena: all real pros in top notch kit with high powered weapons but it's a fair deal this time - you'll get exactly what they have. The only thing is, you don't get medkits or bandages in a fight to the death. Ready? Go prove you're the best, GO!",
      "JA_current": "おめでとう、いよいよ決勝だ！ 残すところ後1つ、この逃げ場の無い戦いも、これが最後だ。アリーナには4人のストーカーがいるだろう。全員が外骨格に身を包み、GP-37s で武装したエキスパート揃いだが、今回は公平に執り行う。アンタもまったく同じ装備で挑んでもらおう。ただ一点、戦いが終わるまでメディキットも包帯も使うことは出来ない。準備はいいか？ ベストを尽くして行け！",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_bar:bar_arena_man_job_18#1"
      ]
    },
